{"words": [{"text": "أَوَلَمْ", "translation": "Do not"}, {"text": "يَنظُرُوا۟", "translation": "they look"}, {"text": "فِى", "translation": "in"}, {"text": "مَلَكُوتِ", "translation": "(the) dominion"}, {"text": "ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ", "translation": "(of) the heavens"}, {"text": "وَٱلْأَرْضِ", "translation": "and the earth"}, {"text": "وَمَا", "translation": "and what"}, {"text": "خَلَقَ", "translation": "has (been) created"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهُ", "translation": "(by) Allah"}, {"text": "مِن", "translation": "of"}, {"text": "شَىْءٍۢ", "translation": "(every)thing"}, {"text": "وَأَنْ", "translation": "and that"}, {"text": "عَسَىٰٓ", "translation": "perhaps"}, {"text": "أَن", "translation": "[that]"}, {"text": "يَكُونَ", "translation": "has"}, {"text": "قَدِ", "translation": "verily"}, {"text": "ٱقْتَرَبَ", "translation": "come near "}, {"text": "أَجَلُهُمْ ۖ", "translation": "their term"}, {"text": "فَبِأَىِّ", "translation": "So in what"}, {"text": "حَدِيثٍۭ", "translation": "statement"}, {"text": "بَعْدَهُۥ", "translation": "after this"}, {"text": "يُؤْمِنُونَ", "translation": "will they believe"}], "sahih": "Do they not look into the realm of the heavens and the earth and everything that Allāh has created and [think] that perhaps their appointed time has come near? So in what statement [i.e., message] hereafter will they believe?"}